    "Html": "<h3>Thank You for Your Support</h3>\n<p>We just wrapped up our end-of-year donation drive. As you know, your contributions make NutritionFacts.org possible. Whether you donated or not, I appreciate your support in keeping evidence-based information alive.</p>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan.png/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-51569 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"149\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan.png 800w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-120x90.png 120w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-768x570.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-720x535.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-540x401.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-269x200.png 269w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/kelly-and-ryan-703x522.png 703w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a>And speaking of getting evidence-based eating info out to millions, I’m honored to have been invited to be on ABC’s Live with Kelly and Ryan. Make sure to tune in on <span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1525465168\"><span class=\"aQJ\">Thursday, January 11th</span></span>!</p>\n<h3 class=\"m_2762650815188843251null\"> </h3>\n<h3 class=\"m_2762650815188843251null\"> </h3>\n<h3 class=\"m_2762650815188843251null\">New DVD Covers Mammograms + More Coconut Oil &amp; Avocados</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd.jpg/\"><img decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-51571 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"201\" height=\"201\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd.jpg 800w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-768x768.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-500x500.jpg 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-720x720.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-540x540.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-200x200.jpg 200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/40-dvd-522x522.jpg 522w\" sizes=\"(max-width: 201px) 100vw, 201px\"/></a>My new DVD is out today and is available as a streaming video so you can start watching it immediately. As you can see below, the main focus is on mammograms. Most women are just told what to do, rather than being given the facts necessary to make a fully informed decision. That’s why I decided to do a deep dive into the topic. All of these videos will eventually be available for free online over the next few months, but if you don’t want to wait, you can watch them all streaming <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/videos?mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2040&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437356000&amp;usg=AFQjCNG1D0du5gnc_f3fk5-B8qvXlmXVcg\">right now</a>.</p>\n<div>Here’s the full list of chapters from the new volume—a preview of what’s to come over the next few months on NutritionFacts.org:</div>\n<ol>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Coconut Oil and Abdominal Fat</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Benefits of Nutritional Yeast for Cancer</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Lead in Calcium Supplements</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">9 out of 10 Women Misinformed about Mammograms</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Mammogram Recommendations: Why the Conflicting Guidelines?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Is Autism Really on the Rise?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">The Role of Pesticides and Pollution in Autism</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Should Women Get Mammograms Starting at Age 40?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Do Mammograms Save Lives?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Are Avocados Fattening?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Consequences of False-Positive Mammogram Results</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Do Mammograms Hurt?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">The Role of Dairy and Gluten in Canker Sores</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Can Mammogram Radiation Cause Breast Cancer?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Understanding the Mammogram Paradox</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Is Marijuana Addictive?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Does Marijuana Cause Health Problems?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Overtreatment of Stage 0 Breast Cancer DCIS</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Women Deserve to Know the Truth About Mammograms</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Do Cell Phones Lower Sperm Counts?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Does Laptop Wi-Fi Lower Sperm Counts?</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Breast Cancer and the 5 Year Survival Rate Myth</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Why Mammograms Don’t Appear to Save Lives</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Why Patients Aren’t Informed About Mammograms</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">The Pros and Cons of Mammograms</li>\n<li value=\"NaN\">Dining by Traffic Light</li>\n</ol>\n<div>Order my new DVD as a video download/streaming at <a href=\"https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://drgreger.org/collections/downloads?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNGUEw1JUBXJZU0JhTqN2C6EraGZ4g\">DrGreger.org/collections/<wbr/>downloads</a>.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<h3>Become a Monthly Supporter</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix.jpg/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-51573 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix.jpg\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"135\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix.jpg 1018w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-960x650.jpg 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-768x520.jpg 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-720x487.jpg 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-540x365.jpg 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-296x200.jpg 296w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2018/01/nflix-771x522.jpg 771w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>If you were a regular supporter, you’d already be a mammogram expert by now, having already received a link to the new DVD. New DVDs are released every nine weeks. If you’d like to automatically receive them before they’re even available to the public, please consider becoming a monthly donor.</p>\n<p>\nAnyone signing up on the <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/donate/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNFJwcYHhOqByCBDIkTTe37vCIprHw\">donation page</a> to become a $25 monthly contributor will receive the next three downloads for free, and anyone signing up as a $50 monthly contributor will get a whole year’s worth of new DVDs (as physical DVDs, downloads, streaming, your choice). If you signed up for physical copies, you should have already received this volume, but if not please email DVDhelp@NutritionFacts.org and we’ll make everything all better.</p>\n<h3>Live Q&amp;A January 25th</h3>\n<p><a href=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png/\"><img loading=\"lazy\" decoding=\"async\" class=\"wp-image-51462 alignleft\" src=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png\" alt=\"\" width=\"200\" height=\"200\" srcset=\"https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square.png 2000w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-960x960.png 960w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-768x768.png 768w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1024x1024.png 1024w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-500x500.png 500w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-1200x1200.png 1200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-720x720.png 720w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-540x540.png 540w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-200x200.png 200w, https://assets.nutritionfacts.org/2017/12/LiveQANewsletter-Square-522x522.png 522w\" sizes=\"auto, (max-width: 200px) 100vw, 200px\"/></a>Every month now I do Q&amp;As live from my treadmill, and <strong>January 25</strong> is the day.</p>\n<ul>\n<li><strong>Facebook Live</strong>: At 7<span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1525465169\"><span class=\"aQJ\">:00 p.m. ET</span></span> on January 25th go to our <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.facebook.com/NutritionFacts.org/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHyyzO3C3BKZU_4n8TE94bvUJ0mpg\">Facebook page</a> to watch live and ask questions.</li>\n<li><strong>YouTube Live Stream: </strong>At 8<span class=\"aBn\" tabindex=\"0\" data-term=\"goog_1525465170\"><span class=\"aQJ\">:00 p.m. ET on January 25th</span></span> go <a href=\"http://bit.ly/2qfmMdC\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/watch?v%3DY1VRvxXVhvc%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHe7iQTVuZsj4fvjjzp184ysaH8qA\">here</a> to watch live and ask even more questions! </li>\n</ul>\n<p>You can catch all of my past live YouTube Q&amp;As <a href=\"https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list=PL5TLzNi5fYd9R7CiZNRtPy7X6Yta-SSIy&amp;utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.youtube.com/playlist?list%3DPL5TLzNi5fYd9R7CiZNRtPy7X6Yta-SSIy%26utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNHPUi56U_icpcd84WbFcYcvLxelOQ\">here</a> and Faceboook Q&amp;As <a href=\"https://www.facebook.com/pg/NutritionFacts.org/videos?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://www.facebook.com/pg/NutritionFacts.org/videos?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNEaVhc-X6Zp5Xh6ATPR4jd8Qrj-Vg\">here</a>. If that’s not enough, remember I have an audio podcast to keep you company at <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/?utm_source=NutritionFacts.org&amp;utm_campaign=6ab2e12c4c-Volume+40&amp;utm_medium=email&amp;utm_term=0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-&amp;mc_cid=6ab2e12c4c&amp;mc_eid=[UNIQID]/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\" data-saferedirecturl=\"https://www.google.com/url?hl=en&amp;q=https://nutritionfacts.org/audio/?utm_source%3DNutritionFacts.org%26utm_campaign%3D6ab2e12c4c-Volume%2B40%26utm_medium%3Demail%26utm_term%3D0_40f9e497d1-6ab2e12c4c-%26mc_cid%3D6ab2e12c4c%26mc_eid%3D%5BUNIQID%5D&amp;source=gmail&amp;ust=1514063437357000&amp;usg=AFQjCNE4yxL6MXBqRug8UbGJhVA9Ppnybg\">https://nutritionfacts.org/<wbr/>audio.</a> </p>\n<p>In health,</p>\n<p><b>Michael Greger, M.D.</b></p>\n<p>PS: If you haven’t yet, you can subscribe to my free videos <a href=\"http://www.nutritionfacts.us5.list-manage.com/subscribe?u=c1bae6687e1e6ab175fb56913&amp;id=40f9e497d1\"><u><b>here</b></u></a><b> </b>and watch my live, year-in-review presentations:</p>\n<ul>\n<li>2012: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/uprooting-the-leading-causes-of-death/\"><u><b>Uprooting the Leading Causes of Death</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2013: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/more-than-an-apple-a-day-preventing-our-most-common-diseases/\"><u><b>More Than an Apple a Day</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2014: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/from-table-to-able/\"><u><b>From Table to Able: Combating Disabling Diseases with Food</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2015: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/food-as-medicine/\"><u><b>Food as Medicine: Preventing and Treating the Most Dreaded Diseases with Diet</b></u></a></li>\n<li>2016: <a href=\"https://nutritionfacts.org/video/how-not-to-die/\"><u><b>How Not To Die: The Role of Diet in Preventing, Arresting, and Reversing Our Top 15 Killers</b></u></a></li>\n</ul>"
